  "items": [
    {
      "source": "<code>PersistenceExceptionTranslator</code> beans are sorted according to Spring's\ndependency ordering rules: see <a href=\"../../core/Ordered.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>Ordered</code></a> and\n<a href=\"../../core/annotation/Order.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.core.annotation\"><code>Order</code></a>. Note that such beans will\nget retrieved from any scope, not just singleton scope.",
      "translation": "`PersistenceExceptionTranslator` 豆根据 Spring 的依赖排序规则进行排序：请参阅 <a href=\"../../core/Ordered.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core\"><code>Ordered</code></a> 和 <a href=\"../../core/annotation/Order.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.core.annotation\"><code>Order</code></a>。请注意，此类豆将从任何范围检索，而不仅仅是单例范围。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Translates native resource exceptions to Spring's\n<a href=\"../DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.dao\"><code>DataAccessException</code></a> hierarchy.\nAutodetects beans that implement the\n<a href=\"../support/PersistenceExceptionTranslator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.dao.support\"><code>PersistenceExceptionTranslator</code></a> interface, which are subsequently asked to translate\ncandidate exceptions.",
      "translation": "将原生资源异常转换为 Spring 的 <a href=\"../DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.dao\"><code>DataAccessException</code></a> 层次结构。自动检测实现了 <a href=\"../support/PersistenceExceptionTranslator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.dao.support\"><code>PersistenceExceptionTranslator</code></a> 接口的 Bean，并随后请求这些 Bean 转换候选异常。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "All of Spring's applicable resource factories (for example,\n<a href=\"../../orm/jpa/LocalContainerEntityManagerFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.orm.jpa\"><code>LocalContainerEntityManagerFactoryBean</code></a>)\nimplement the <code>PersistenceExceptionTranslator</code> interface out of the box.\nAs a consequence, all that is usually needed to enable automatic exception\ntranslation is marking all affected beans (such as Repositories or DAOs)\nwith the <code>@Repository</code> annotation, along with defining this post-processor\nas a bean in the application context.",
      "translation": "Spring 所有适用的资源工厂（例如，<a href=\"../../orm/jpa/LocalContainerEntityManagerFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.orm.jpa\"><code>LocalContainerEntityManagerFactoryBean</code></a>）都默认实现了 <code>PersistenceExceptionTranslator</code> 接口。因此，要启用自动异常翻译，通常只需将所有受影响的 Bean（例如 Repository 或 DAO）标记为带有 <code>@Repository</code> 注解，并在应用程序上下文中定义此后置处理器为一个 Bean。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This setter property exists so that developers can provide their own\n(non-Spring-specific) annotation type to indicate that a class has a\nrepository role.",
      "translation": "此 Setter 属性存在，以便开发人员提供自己的（非 Spring 特定的）注解类型，以指示某个类具有存储库角色。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<ul class=\"tag-list-long\">\n<li><a href=\"PersistenceExceptionTranslationAdvisor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.dao.annotation\"><code>PersistenceExceptionTranslationAdvisor</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../../stereotype/Repository.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.stereotype\"><code>Repository</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.dao\"><code>DataAccessException</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../support/PersistenceExceptionTranslator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.dao.support\"><code>PersistenceExceptionTranslator</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../../serialized-form.html#org.springframework.dao.annotation.PersistenceExceptionTranslationPostProcessor\">Serialized Form</a></li>\n</ul>",
      "translation": "<ul class=\"tag-list-long\">\n<li><a href=\"PersistenceExceptionTranslationAdvisor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.dao.annotation\"><code>PersistenceExceptionTranslationAdvisor</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../../stereotype/Repository.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.stereotype\"><code>Repository</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../DataAccessException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.dao\"><code>DataAccessException</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../support/PersistenceExceptionTranslator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.dao.support\"><code>PersistenceExceptionTranslator</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../../serialized-form.html#org.springframework.dao.annotation.PersistenceExceptionTranslationPostProcessor\">Serialized Form</a></li>\n</ul>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../aop/framework/autoproxy/AbstractBeanFactoryAwareAdvisingPostProcessor.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\">setBeanFactory</a></code> in class <code><a href=\"../../aop/framework/autoproxy/AbstractBeanFactoryAwareAdvisingPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.framework.autoproxy\">AbstractBeanFactoryAwareAdvisingPostProcessor</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"../../aop/framework/autoproxy/AbstractBeanFactoryAwareAdvisingPostProcessor.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\">setBeanFactory</a></code>` 类中的 `<code><a href=\"../../aop/framework/autoproxy/AbstractBeanFactoryAwareAdvisingPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.aop.framework.autoproxy\">AbstractBeanFactoryAwareAdvisingPostProcessor</a></code>`",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>repositoryAnnotationType</code> - the desired annotation type",
      "translation": "<code>repositoryAnnotationType</code> - 期望的注解类型",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked after the population of normal bean properties\nbut before an initialization callback such as\n<a href=\"../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\"><code>InitializingBean.afterPropertiesSet()</code></a> or a custom init-method.",
      "translation": "在普通 Bean 属性填充之后，但在初始化回调（例如 <a href=\"../../beans/factory/InitializingBean.html#afterPropertiesSet()\"><code>InitializingBean.afterPropertiesSet()</code></a>）或自定义 init-method 之前调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\">BeanFactoryAware</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/BeanFactoryAware.html#setBeanFactory(org.springframework.beans.factory.BeanFactory)\">BeanFactoryAware</a></code></span>",
